  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support Measures 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Action seeks to commit the EUR 3 million currently available under the Cooperation Facility as part of the AAP 2025. This amount would be allocated to the 2025 Support Measures for Bolivia, in line with the regional Support Measures Decision.The overall objective is to contribute to a more effective and robust EU&#xbf;Bolivia partnership by enhancing the impact of actions implemented under the Multi-Annual Indicative Programme (MIP) 2021&#xbf;2027. Particular focus will be given to interventions aligned with the Global Gateway Investment Initiative, which serves as a central pillar of the EU&#xbf;s engagement in Bolivia, while also supporting collaboration with EU Member States under initiatives such as the Team Europe Initiative (TEI) on &#xbf;Green and Resilient Development&#xbf;, regional TEIs, and other relevant programmes and strategic frameworks such as the Roadmap for Civil Society, the Gender Action Plan, carbon credit schemes, circular economy, among others.</narrative>
  </description>
